---
title: Loan Approval Sequence - Chainlink Functions + Authority Brief
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Client
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Express API
    participant ML as FastAPI ML
    participant DON as Chainlink DON
    participant SC as LocalBank
    participant AP as Approver

    U->>FE: Submit loan (USDC)
    FE->>API: POST /loans (EIP-712)
    API->>SC: applyLoan()
    API->>ML: Compute RF + SHAP score
    ML->>DON: Risk score request
    DON->>DON: Multi-node consensus
    DON->>SC: commitRiskScore + revealScore
    API->>AP: Authority Brief (SHAP top-3)
    alt Approve
        AP->>SC: approveLoan (SCORE_REVEALED)
        SC-->>U: Disbursed
    else Reject
        AP->>SC: rejectLoan(reason)
        SC-->>U: Rejected + explanation
    end
